-2 font-medium border-l border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:border-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:border-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;:hover]:border-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;:hover]:border-primary-light dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Partitioned Joins (Beta)</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:1rem" href="#performance" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium border-l border-gray-950/5 dark:border-white/10 hover:border-gray-950/20 dark:hover:border-white/20 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:border-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:border-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;:hover]:border-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;:hover]:border-primary-light dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Performance</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div><div class="grow w-full mx-auto [contain:inline-size] xl:w-[calc(100%-28rem)] max-w-(--content-width,none)" id="content-area"><header id="header" class="relative leading-none @container/page-header"><div class="mt-0.5 space-y-2.5"><div class="eyebrow h-5 text-primary dark:text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold">JOINs</div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:ite